        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Consolidated ownership and operation of our portfolio enhances the value we deliver by enabling an integrated suite of value-added services across a reliable cold chain network.",
        "start_character": 5140,
        "end_character": 5317
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In February 2023, we announced our transformation program “Project Orion” designed to drive future growth and achieve our long-term strategic objectives, through investment in our technology systems and business processes across our global platform.",
        "start_character": 14075,
        "end_character": 14324
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our core business is our Warehouse segment, where we provide temperature-controlled warehouse storage and related handling and other warehouse services.",
        "start_character": 16641,
        "end_character": 16793
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under our Third-Party Managed segment, we manage warehouses on behalf of third parties and provide warehouse management services to leading food manufacturers and retailers in their owned facilities.",
        "start_character": 17860,
        "end_character": 18059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide multi-modal global freight forwarding services to support our customers’ needs in certain markets.",
        "start_character": 17724,
        "end_character": 17838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe using our third-party management services allows our customers to increase efficiency, lower costs, reduce supply-chain risks and focus on their core businesses.",
        "start_character": 18060,
        "end_character": 18232
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide services to food producers, distributors, retailers, and e-tailers whose businesses, in some cases, are seasonal or cyclical.",
        "start_character": 20736,
        "end_character": 20872
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we administered a company-wide engagement survey, available in 22 languages, to emphasize engagement, development, culture, and inclusion among associates.",
        "start_character": 26650,
        "end_character": 26814
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, due to the amount of ammonia stored at some of our facilities, we are also subject to compliance with OSHA’s Process Safety Management of Highly Hazardous Chemicals standard and OSHA’s ongoing National Emphasis Program related to potential releases of highly hazardous chemicals.",
        "start_character": 41060,
        "end_character": 41352
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our properties are subject to a wide range of environmental laws and regulations in each of the locations in which we operate, and compliance with these requirements involves significant capital and operating costs.",
        "start_character": 37387,
        "end_character": 37602
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "This is in addition to requirements that we satisfy existing Good Manufacturing Practices with respect to the holding of foods, as set forth in FDA regulations.",
        "start_character": 39486,
        "end_character": 39646
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012274-5eff0e36eb72c3ed",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012274",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to developing and implementing programs and practices that foster a supportive learning environment and encompass communication of diverse perspectives and experiences.",
        "start_character": 25815,
        "end_character": 26000
      }
